Agentic Robot Shop

Includes modified Apache-2.0 source and assets from Instana / Stan’s Robot Shop:
https://github.com/instana/robot-shop
Pinned upstream revision: 55292e2199f2fb00a165b1f7d3045fe7f8922038

Modifications include standard OpenTelemetry instrumentation, modern container
bases, shopping assistant and MCP integration, synthetic traffic/failure tools,
raw-observability AI SRE and portable Kubernetes assets. This is an independent
extension, not an official upstream release. Upstream license is preserved.
